  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the OnAdPlayRewarded event and AdPlayRewardedEventArgs, AdConfig.UserId for rewarded server-to-server callbacks (%user% via /ri), and AdEndEventArgs.MSFTNotify / AdEndEventArgs.CallToActionClicked. Supports Native AOT. The /config response parser now reads both the v5 and v7 shapes. BREAKING: LiftoffRewarded, LiftoffInterstitial and LiftoffBanner have been removed -- use AdConfig.UserId in place of LiftoffRewarded.UserId. BREAKING: the AdEndEventArgs constructor now requires msftNotify and callToActionClicked. BREAKING: the minimum target framework is now net8.0-windows10.0.19041.0, with Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK 1.6.250602001 and Microsoft.Web.WebView2 1.0.4129.50 floors required for AOT support; RuntimeIdentifiers are now win-x86 / win-x64 / win-arm64. DEPRECATED: AdStartEventArgs.CampaignID -- use CreativeID; the campaign id goes permanently empty at SDK 7.4.0.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "Vungle SDK for WinUI 3",
  "verbatimVersion": "7.1.0",
